# RipplerX for WebCLAP

RipplerX by tilr, a physically modeled synth, ported to WebCLAP. This is not an official RipplerX release.

- RipplerX: https://github.com/tiagolr/ripplerx (commit 11683a6, version 1.5.18)
- This port, and the complete source of this bundle: @SOURCE_URL@
  Build it with `scripts/build-ripplerx.sh`, which fetches every dependency below at the commit named here.

## License

The bundle as a whole is licensed under the **GNU Affero General Public License, version 3** (`LICENSE`).

RipplerX is GPL-3.0 (`licenses/GPL-3.0.txt`). Both modules contain the JUCE framework, used under the AGPL-3.0, so
`module.wasm` and `ui/ui.wasm` are AGPL-3.0. GPL-3.0 section 13 permits the combination.

This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied
warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the licenses for details.

RipplerX is a port of tilr's Rippler2 JSFX, which builds on Saike's [Partials](https://github.com/JoepVanlier/JSFX)
(MIT) and takes its models after AAS Chromaphone and Collision.

## Components

| Component | In | Copyright | License |
|---|---|---|---|
| [RipplerX](https://github.com/tiagolr/ripplerx), incl. presets, images and mallet samples | both | 2025 tilr | GPL-3.0 |
| Limiter in RipplerX (port of the FairlyChildish limiter JSFX) | both | 2006, Thomas Scott Stillwell | BSD-3-Clause style |
| WebCLAP port ([juce-webclap-plugins](https://github.com/andremichelle/juce-webclap-plugins)) | both | André Michelle | MIT |
| [JUCE](https://juce.com) | both | Raw Material Software Limited | AGPL-3.0 |
| [MTS-ESP client](https://github.com/ODDSound/MTS-ESP) | both | 2021 ODDSound Ltd. | 0BSD |
| [CLAP](https://github.com/free-audio/clap) | module | 2021 Alexandre Bique | MIT |
| Ubuntu Medium font | ui | 2011 Canonical Ltd. | Ubuntu Font Licence 1.0 (`licenses/UFL-1.0-Ubuntu.txt`) |
| [DejaVu Sans](https://dejavu-fonts.github.io) font | ui | Bitstream, Tavmjong Bah; DejaVu changes public domain | Bitstream Vera (`licenses/DejaVu.txt`) |

